{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-07-26 10:20:00', 'title': 'S&P CORELOGIC CASE-SHILLER INDEX REPORTS ANNUAL HOME PRICE GAIN OF 19.7% IN MAY', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JULY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P DOW JONES INDICES (S&P DJI) TODAY RELEASED THE LATEST RESULTS FOR THE S&P CORELOGIC CASE-SHILLER INDICES, THE LEADING MEASURE OF U.S. HOME PRICES. DATA RELEASED TODAY FOR MAY 2022 SHOW THAT HOME PRICES CONTINUE TO INCREASE ACROSS THE U.S. MORE THAN 27 YEARS OF HISTORY ARE AVAILABLE FOR THE DATA SERIES AND CAN BE ACCESSED IN FULL BY GOING TO HTTPS://WWW.SPGLOBAL.COM/SPDJI/EN/INDEX-FAMILY/INDICATORS/SP-CORELOGIC-CASE-SHILLER/.'}